# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Dominator publishes chain tail at %base + 512. Dominated chain head
# needs %base + 256 (smaller than tail). Head reroots to
# G_PTR_ADD %a2, -256. Proves the offset-fit guard accepts negative
# offsets (padda encodes them via scaled immediates).
